longs whatever is in the heavens and the earth. Unquestionably, the promise of Allāh is truth, but most of them do not know.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":55,"sd":null},{"k":"10:56","t":"He gives life and causes death, and to Him you will be returned.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":56,"sd":null},{"k":"10:57","t":"O mankind, there has come to you instruction from your Lord and healing for what is in the breasts and guidance and mercy for the believers.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":57,"sd":null},{"k":"10:58","t":"Say, \"In the bounty of Allāh and in His mercy - in that let them rejoice; it is better than what they accumulate.\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"10:59","t":"Say, \"Have you seen what Allāh has sent down to you of provision of which you have made [some] lawful and [some] unlawful?\" Say, \"Has Allāh permitted you [to do so], or do you invent [something] about Allāh?\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":59,"sd":null},{"k":"10:60","t":"And what will be the supposition of those who invent falsehood about Allāh on the Day of Resurrection? Indeed, Allāh is the possessor of bounty for the people, but most of them are not grateful.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":60,"sd":null},{"k":"10:61","t":"And, [O Muḥammad], you are not [engaged] in any matter and do not recite any of the Qur’ān and you [people] do not do any deed except that We are witness over you when you are involved in it. And not absent from your Lord is any [part] of an atom's weight within the earth or within the heaven or [anything] smaller than that or greater but that it is in a clear register.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":61,"sd":null}],"juz":11,"hizb":22,"surahs":[10],"sajdah":false}